e hope we've managed to show you one thing: how we work, what we believe in and why this role at PREMATCH is something special. Maybe this is exactly the moment you've been waiting for: a team that thinks big, a vision that actually moves things and the chance to help reshape amateur football digitally – together with us. Now it's your turn. Click on ‘Apply now’ – it’ll only take 2 minutes. All we need is your CV. You can tell us the rest in our simple, short application form. Don’t meet all the requirements? If you think you’re still a good fit – just apply Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow" ;
