    schema:description "Your mission You'll help bring our marketing projects and events from idea to execution, coordinating timelines, stakeholders, materials and every practical detail that keeps things moving. Your typical day will look like supporting marketing content creation, booking travel and accommodation, prepping event materials, coordinating different kinds of marketing activities etc. No task is too small and no day looks the same. You will love this role if you love to roll up your sleeves, commit to completing tasks, help out and just make things happen, whether that's chasing down a missing detail, fixing a last-minute hiccup, or figuring out something at short notice. You bring energy, initiative and a genuine love for working with people on a variety of tasks and a massive can-do attitude. Location You are based in Dresden or nearby and can regularly work from our Dresden office. What You'll Do Support trade fairs, partner and customer events, and internal formats, logistics, materials, schedules, onsite hustle when needed Help create and publish content across LinkedIn and other channels Research topics, events, partners, and opportunities Take ownership of your own workstreams as you grow Be the person who spots what needs doing—and just does it Your profile You are currently studying marketing, communications, business administration, event management, or a related subject You have strong organizational skills, work reliably and independently, have an eye for detail, and enjoy bringing structure to several parallel topics. You feel comfortable in a fast-paced environment with changing priorities and enjoy that every day can look different. You are professionally fluent in German and English. High energy, can-do attitude, loves people, loves getting things done and no task is too small or too much. You are awesome if: You have already gained practical experience through an internship, working-student position, student initiative, or your own projects. You spot what needs to be done and are often the person who makes sure it actually happens. You are curious about robotics, software, industrial automation, or Physical AI. Why us? Make an impact! Work on an innovative, deep tech product that adds value to the robotics world and to society! Become a crucial part of something new, big and exciting where you can truly make an impact! Our teams inspire! Cross-functional communication is key. You'll get to know many of your 100+ colleagues. Collaborate with great people on our international teams who value knowledge sharing and unique ways of doing things! Be authentic! Work in a value-driven environment where everything may not be perfect, but we're working on it! Your feedback is required while you receive feedback and appreciation for your work! Help others! You can have up to 3 days of volunteer time off to help your favorite charity. Develop yourself! We offer training and mental health opportunities so that you can develop both mentally and professionally. And there is even more! Enjoy our free lunch, snacks and drinks, team events, 30 days of annual vacation + additional rest during Christmas season until New Year. If your child gets sick, we assure that a 100% of your usual earnings will be paid while you take care of your little one. Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow" ;
