    schema:datePosted "2026-09-06"^^xsd:date ;
    schema:description "We're looking for a Product Engineer, Backend (Rust) to join White Circle, an AI Safety company building the policy enforcement and optimization layer for AI systems. Backed by $11M from senior leaders at OpenAI, Anthropic, HuggingFace, Mistral, and DeepMind, White Circle processes 100M+ API calls monthly and runs its own LLMs in production. You will Design and build Rust backend services handling real-time policy checks at scale. Own features end-to-end – API design, schema, deployment, monitoring. Improve performance and reliability through connection pooling, caching, query optimization, and observability. Collaborate directly with product and research. Requirements Production experience with Rust, Python, or Go. Comfortable with async Rust (Tokio), Axum/Actix, and PostgreSQL – schema design, query optimization, debugging. Strong system design fundamentals: trade-offs, failure modes, scaling. Relocation to Paris or London (hybrid) required. Stack Rust, Tokio, Axum/Actix, PostgreSQL. Bonus: ClickHouse, Redis, Kafka, LLM infra (routing, inference, RAG), or high-throughput monitoring background. We offer $80k–$150k/year salary + equity; higher figures can be negotiated. Official employment, visa and relocation help. Compensation: $80K – $150K • Higher figures and equity are negotiable • $80K – $150K • Higher figures and equity are negotiable Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow" ;
