    schema:datePosted "2026-09-07"^^xsd:date ;
    schema:description "TL;DR: We’re looking for a hands-on Talent Lead to own and build our hiring function from scratch. You’ll personally drive hiring across the company, build scalable recruiting processes, track hiring performance, and work closely with the Head of People and hiring managers across GTM, Ops, Research, and Product. About us White Circle is an AI Safety company building the safety, reliability, and optimization layer for AI systems. At the core of our platform are policies – simple natural-language rules that define what an AI model should and shouldn’t do. We automatically test, enforce, and continuously improve these policies at scale. We’ve raised $11M from top funds, founders, and senior leaders at OpenAI, Anthropic, HuggingFace, Mistral, DeepMind, Datadog, Sentry, and others We process over one hundred million API calls every month We fine-tune and train our own LLMs so they run faster and cheaper than any open or proprietary model We’re a small, highly focused team. If you want to work deeply on hard problems, see your work ship to production quickly, and influence how AI safety is actually built – you’re the one we need. You will: Own and run the hiring process end-to-end (sourcing, screening, interviews, and closing) Personally source and hire candidates across the company (this is a hands-on recruiting role) Build our hiring processes and infrastructure from scratch, including interview loops, scorecards, pipelines, and candidate tracking Work closely with hiring managers to define roles, hiring priorities, and candidate profiles Drive hiring across a wide range of functions, including GTM, Ops, Research, Product, and Engineering Lead international hiring across the US, EU, UK, and other markets as we expand Build and maintain hiring metrics and reporting, including pipeline conversion, time to hire, source performance, and offer acceptance Use hiring data to identify bottlenecks and continuously improve the recruiting process Build and maintain strong sourcing channels across different functions and geographies Develop a strong candidate experience and represent White Circle throughout the hiring process Help define and improve our approach to hiring, including how we assess candidates and make hiring decisions Partner with leadership on long-term talent planning and hiring strategy You’ll fit right in if you: Have several years of experience running hiring at a startup, ideally in an early-stage or high-growth environment Have personally hired a meaningful number of people and are comfortable owning the full recruiting process yourself Have built hiring processes and recruiting operations from scratch Have experience hiring across multiple functions, including GTM, Operations, Research, Product, and Engineering Have experience with international hiring across multiple countries and markets Are comfortable working directly with leadership and senior hiring managers Are highly data-driven and comfortable tracking and analysing recruiting metrics Are an excellent sourcer and know how to find strong candidates beyond simply posting jobs Communicate clearly and build strong relationships with both candidates and hiring managers Are comfortable operating independently in an environment where processes are still being built Speak and write fluent English (C1+) A big plus: Experience hiring for AI, ML, and Research roles Experience building a recruiting function as the first or one of the first talent hires Experience hiring in the US, EU, and UK Experience with employer branding and building a strong talent pipeline Experience using AI tools to improve sourcing, screening, research, or recruiting ops Why White Circle Meaningful equity package Paid time off in line with your local regulations, no matter where you work from All the hardware, tools, and services you need Covered subscriptions for AI agents Team off-sites twice a year: we’ve recently been to the Alps, Saint-Tropez, and Mabella How we hire Introductory call with Head of People (25 min) Practical Recruitment Exercise with Head of People (60 min) Final conversation with our CEO (45 min) Please submit your application in English. Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow" ;
