<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-web-developer-contract-immediate-start-london-477825> a prov:Entity,
        schema:JobPosting ;
    dcterms:source <https://openknowledgegraphs.com/jobs/source/arbeitnow> ;
    prov:generatedAtTime "2026-09-08T07:48:20+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://openknowledgegraphs.com/jobs/live/occurrence/arbeitnow-web-developer-contract-immediate-start-london-477825/1>,
        <https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/1st20formations/web-developer-contract-immediate-start-london-477825> ;
    kgjobs:active true ;
    kgjobs:canonicalFingerprint "9414cc8fc18c69111fb2bdaeb7abb44e317d65704115cd3e6628e181a8be048f" ;
    kgjobs:classification "not_match" ;
    kgjobs:firstSeenAt "2026-09-08T07:48:20+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    kgjobs:lastSeenAt "2026-09-08T07:48:20+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    kgjobs:reconciliationReason "no reviewed first-party candidate" ;
    kgjobs:sourceOccurrence <https://openknowledgegraphs.com/jobs/live/occurrence/arbeitnow-web-developer-contract-immediate-start-london-477825/1> ;
    kgjobs:sourceRecordId "web-developer-contract-immediate-start-london-477825" ;
    schema:datePosted "2026-09-08"^^xsd:date ;
    schema:description "About 1st Formations At 1st Formations, we empower entrepreneurs to start, run, and grow their businesses with confidence. Running a business shouldn’t be slowed down by company formation, statutory compliance, accounting, or payroll. From day one, these essentials should be seamless, reliable, and intelligently handled — freeing founders to focus on building and scaling. We’re a leading UK provider of company formation and compliance services, building a modern, fully integrated technology platform that supports founders at every stage of their journey. Our platform brings together formation, compliance, accounting, payroll, and ongoing business support in one cohesive experience. No stitched-together services. No legacy workflows disguised as software. Just a single, scalable platform built for ambitious founders who want to move fast, stay compliant, and grow with confidence. Why Join Us Now? You’ll be joining a business with strong momentum, clear direction, and real opportunity for progression. £18m annual revenue, including £9m ARR Over 1 million companies formed Certified B Corp and Carbon Neutral Business Forecast to grow 5x–10x over the next three years The Role The Front-End Web Developer is responsible for building and maintaining high-quality, performant web applications across BSQ Group's growing portfolio of websites and products. This is a hands-on, mid-level role for a developer who is fluent in modern front-end fundamentals and confident translating design into clean, working code. Working closely with designers and the wider engineering team, you'll turn Figma designs into pixel-accurate, responsive interfaces, and help build single page applications that are fast, accessible, and easy to maintain. Key Responsibilities Front-End Development • Build and maintain web applications using HTML, JavaScript, and Node.js • Develop and maintain single page applications (SPAs) with clean, modular, maintainable code • Write front-end code that is performant, responsive, and cross-browser compatible • Follow established coding standards and best practices for readability and maintainability Design Implementation • Translate Figma designs into accurate, high-quality front-end code • Work closely with designers to ensure visual and interaction details are faithfully implemented • Flag design or UX issues early and suggest practical, technically sound solutions Collaboration & Delivery • Work alongside other developers, designers, and product stakeholders to deliver features end-to-end • Participate in code reviews, giving and receiving constructive feedback • Communicate progress, blockers, and technical considerations clearly to the wider team Quality & Maintenance • Test and debug applications to ensure a smooth, reliable user experience • Support ongoing maintenance, bug fixes, and incremental improvements across live sites and applications • Contribute to improving front-end tooling, workflows, and documentation over time What We Are Looking For • Solid, hands-on experience as a Front End Web Developer, building real web applications • Strong working knowledge of HTML, JavaScript, Next.js and Node.js • Experience with Payload CMS • Proven experience implementing Figma (or similar) designs into accurate, production-ready code • Experience building single page applications (SPAs) • Good understanding of responsive design and cross-browser compatibility • Comfortable working collaboratively with designers, developers, and non-technical stakeholders • A methodical, detail-oriented approach to writing and testing code • Good communication skills and a proactive, ownership-driven attitude What We Offer Competitive salary and comprehensive benefits package Hybrid working model Real opportunities for progression as the business scales The chance to influence both customer experience and product development A culture that values ownership, impact, and continuous learning Equal Opportunities 1st Formations is an equal opportunity employer and is committed to creating a diverse and inclusive workplace. We consider all applicants for employment without regard to race, colour, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, criminal history, disability, or gender identity. We encourage individuals from all backgrounds to apply. If you have a disability or special need that requires accommodation, please let us know. Compensation: £70K – £85K • £70K – £85K Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow" ;
